<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '26px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>选窗：从图里挑出最该一起优化的 20 帧</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>08 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '8px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>不是“最近 20 帧”，而是“和当前集合连接最强的那个”——一次加一个，贪心扩张到 20 个。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 600, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11 }}>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输入</b>　③ 更新后的加权协视图</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>做法</b>　每步选“与已选集合累计内点数最大”的节点加入，直到凑满 N</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输出</b>　局部 BA 的变量集合 S（这一步只决定“算谁”，不动数值）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>关键取值</b>　N = 20 帧　·　num_prev_keyframes_miniba_incr = 5</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>每个节点平均只有约 10 条边，所以一次 argmax 的开销可以忽略</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 580, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Image src="figs/fig4_window.png" style={{ width: 580, height: 362 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 5 }}>图 4　实心=已选，红圈=本轮 argmax；贪心比全局最优便宜得多。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '12px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '10px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Image src="formula/f08.png" style={{ width: 437.0, height: 67.5 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 3 }}>消融 NoKFSelection：PSNR 26.29 → 24.56 dB。选窗比匹配本身更影响最终质量——窗选错，后面怎么优化都救不回。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '10px 40px 12px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>前四步合起来只回答一件事：哪些帧该放到同一张桌子上一起算。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
